{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022152753183-1022_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261022152925\"/><p>俄烏戰事持續。</p><p>俄羅斯總統普京和美國總統特使威特科夫周三（21日）在聖彼得堡會面後，俄烏繼續互襲。俄羅斯國防部周四（22日）指，俄軍防空系統過去一夜在俄羅斯各地上空攔截並摧毀808架烏克蘭無人機。烏克蘭首都基輔市也遭受導彈襲擊，造成至少4人受傷。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T07:42:45.730212+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:27:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T13:38:17.046079+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:38:29.614580+00:00","content_hash":"838b09f820858d6859994a765bbdfc4856e698d55ed56082f417e658932b9949","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}